  "body": "Log cabin for sale 1 Serpentine Avenue within the Pinewoods Top 10 camping ground. Please note this is not freehold but part of the Shareholders in Pinewoods. all information regarding purchasing a bach at Pinewoods is on their web site and contains a booklet of all rules and regulations such as no dogs.  No permanent living first 2 years. only school holidays, weekends and summer vacations. see booklet or website for full details. https://www.pinewoods.co.nz/\r\n\r\n\r\nIt has  2 bedrooms, Bed 1 - double bed with sliding door to north deck and bed 2 - bunks opening out to south deck. Fully furnished with washing machine, drier, microwave, stove, heat pump, outside table and 4 chairs and all linen and kitchen items. All ready for your summer holiday. \r\nFlat section and off-street parking. Lovely native trees and bird song.  \r\n\r\n5 minutes walk to 2 beaches, one facing Orewa down Jacobs Ladder the other to Red Beach past the RBSLSC. walking distance to Red Beach shopping Centre, Bus stop 500 metres from park.\r\n\r\nPlease note: the retro caravan  is not part of the sale and will be sold separately. It is fully registered with Electrical WOF. If you are interested in purchasing the caravan please contact owner via the Pinewoods office. It will be listed on Trademe for $18,000. \r\nAll enquiries to Pinewoods office phone 09 4264 526\r\n\r\nPrice $390,000 \r\n\r\nFor more photos inside and out please go to this link.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.pinewoods.co.nz/page6ae7a52ad943feabaaa858ee",
